  "text_pages": [
    "Application Form\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n｜International｜Ryukoku University  You, Unlimited\nNeed Help?\nCenter for the Promotion of Global Education\nApplication Form\nApplication Form\nPrescribed Forms\nExchange Application Spring 2027 Entry\n* Online data entry of basic information is also required\nDefinition of “Exchange Student”:\nA student from one of Ryukoku University’s\nExchange Partner Universities\nREQUIRED READING FOR ALL APPLICANTS (Please read before submitting your data and documents!):\nRyukoku University Guide For Exchange Students\n※English Version\n※Japanese Version\n※Chinese Version\n(1)\n龍谷大学における研究計画書\nPlan of Study at Ryukoku University\n(To be filled out by the Applicant)\n(2)\n日本語能力認定書\nEvaluation of Japanese Language Proficiency\n(with institutional stamp included)\n(To be filled out by a Japanese Language Instructor)\n(3)\n推薦書\nLetter of Recommendation(s)\n(To be filled out by an Academic Advisor/Instructor)\n(4)\n健康診断書\nCertificate of Health\n(To be filled out by the Applicant’s Physician)\n(5)\n日本語能力自己評価表\nGrid for Self-Assessment of Japanese Language Skills\n(To be filled out by the Applicant - Select One)\n※English・Japanese Version\n※Chinese Version\n(6)プレスメントテスト(SPOT テスト)\nSPOT Test (Japanese Placement Test)\n(To be taken online by the Applicant. )\n※Japanese Program Explanation and SPOT Test Instructions\n[REFERENCE ONLY]\nExplanatory Sheet:Grid for Self-Assessment(CEFR Chart)\n※English Version\n※Japanese Version\n※Chinese Version\nIMPORTANT!\nApplicants must have already been nominated by their Home University through our online system.\nAll documents  above (from 1 to 6) must be submitted. Applicants must also be sure to complete  the input of their basic information.\nAll basic  data input and prescribed document submission must be completed by the final  submission deadline.\n[Submission Deadline:\nNovember 9, 2026 (Monday), 23:59 Japan Standard Time (JST)\n]\nThe Applicant should retain a copy of all data and prescribed forms  for their own records.\nIn addition  to the above items (1) through (6), you must also provide a\n[Passport-style ID Photo], [Image of your Passport Photo  Page], an [Official Transcript], and a [Japanese Language Proficiency Test  (JLPT) Score Certificate, if available].\nFor details, please follow the  instructions of the person in charge at your Home University.\nPagetop"
  ],
